  "solution": {
    "text": "On adding non-volatile solute in a solvent, the freezing point of solution decreases.\n$\\mathrm{T}_{\\mathrm{f}} < \\mathrm{T}_{\\mathrm{f}}^0$\nF.P. of solution $ < $ F.P. of pure solvent\n\nAlso V.P. of solution decreases on adding nonvolatile solute in a solvent.<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/aFKF-ULtXrfprVEZA9ut6w_rRWlyOmxrSc1Nd0J5bH0.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
